{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_04_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e3b6304f56e20142af847b60eb087c50d3a9b8dcc7d4937fc3c49e76b470ed0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79ba86437b4f239e4f4bf1157ed42370dba2d276995bd109bea51f841eef2a89",
      "text": "刚才真是太感谢了。托您的福，\n想乐和我，犹如平鳍旗鱼畅游一般……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b78226b78e5760fb57d42d8efa6ef4043c42c592db59eac7fa84fb82cfde267",
      "text": "我和这位克里斯先生，\n都赶上了315 Pro的试镜哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16990c32d05a49ad2c61c8904ad82815dcb1e8e71a50a9d67b4f79ff5d083b28",
      "text": "……哈哈。你们也是这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9cccd65d3d98ac70eddb67e73d8716820f389a4674249528c6605943b27d5e6",
      "text": "突然找上门来，真不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0472b76e749a4c1e6f4fd58ca3c17c6e93878442ed3fa12556c01586a6f15712",
      "text": "听说两位在来试镜的路上被您救了，所以……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bc9f0dde6b8846a536431b1ee1e763a07eb8593c331066e10ec85ef51898671",
      "text": "那张名片，难道说，\n您有考虑过试镜的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e87b95e25ca062daa6398a5bd74f01673114870f736059c302ce545f03d57a4",
      "text": "……啊。刚才正好在想呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:799ef94367818246b68dddf531b005381ab5db5cb25572867e26824a11154660",
      "text": "（年龄和外貌都截然不同的这两人。我还以为，\n是去学校或者去上班的呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adb19b26deabac2e668734668d5a9711cdfb87774e6242ac462c6534a9392ea8",
      "text": "（没想到，居然跟我是一个目的地啊。……嗯。\n这么一看，还真是个性十足的阵容啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29699be921db59b54a9bb8e52f45334238c1df48e805d38106fd819707a7e0e1",
      "text": "（看来这里，会有场愉快的邂逅啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e444f06bb6b5bc0a0397acfe8b06dfb68adc951179e60f8085dfc3624fe50cb5",
      "text": "如果可以的话，现在来参加试镜\n如何呢？对了，您的名字是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70a73499855d498f755ee19a8f04b63eb92a834b0bf6e4074ee66102b9ea69fd",
      "text": "还没报上名字呢。我是葛之叶雨彦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eaf7bb1f3c877afb262db327a1795bf51c54642c835fcfa68e265f2bc2dbf6ab",
      "text": "既然你觉得可以的话，\n那这个机会……我就心怀感激地收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
